    "title": "Printable Christmas Cards | Robin Card Set, Traditional Christmas Card, Instant Digital Download",
    "description": "Send a little cosy Christmas warmth with a card that feels like a treasured winter greeting. These illustrated designs bring heartfelt festive wishes to someone special. ✨\n\nRobin at the Frosted Gate pairs a cheerful, comforting and traditional mood with a refined storybook watercolour-style look. Expect frosted garden details, soft winter light and a palette of ivory, sage, pine, berry red and blue-grey. ❄️\n\nChoose your design\n\nMerry Christmas shows a tender European robin resting on a weathered wooden garden gate, surrounded by frost-touched foliage, pine and a curving holly sprig. An airy pale peach sunrise sky gives the scene a quietly magical feel, while the Merry Christmas greeting sits above in antique-gold serif lettering.\n\nChristmas Wishes places a robin on a snowy gate post beside a glowing lantern, with holly and a snowy village and church spire in the distance.\n\nThe same inside greeting appears in both designs: “Wishing you a joyful Christmas and a happy New Year”.\n\nWhat you receive\n\n• Two Christmas card designs\n• PDF card files in A4 and US Letter formats\n• 4×6 in card panels\n• 3 PNG artwork files\n• Printing guide\n• A4 folded card size: 124 × 186 mm\n• US Letter folded card size: 128 × 192 mm\n\nHow it works\n\nDownload the files, choose your preferred design, print, fold and share your Christmas wishes. The included printing guide is there to help with the printing step.\n\nA warm choice for friends, family or neighbours, these cards let you share a thoughtful seasonal message with a traditional winter feel. May your Christmas greetings arrive with a little extra comfort and cheer. 🎄\n\nThis is an instant digital download supplied as a ZIP of PDF and PNG files. No physical item is shipped.",
